            description: Some("Creates a new Kinesis video stream.  When you create a new stream, Kinesis Video Streams assigns it a version number. When you change the stream's metadata, Kinesis Video Streams updates the version.   CreateStream is an asynchronous operation. For information about how the service works, see How it Works.  You must have permissions for the KinesisVideo:CreateStream action"),
